    <kbd>Q</kbd>/<kbd>E</kbd> Ganti Gear &nbsp; <kbd>C</kbd> Ganti Kamera<br>
    <kbd>U</kbd> Upgrade &nbsp; <kbd>Space</kbd> Rem Tangan &nbsp; <kbd>F</kbd> Isi Ulang Bahan Bakar
