                </li>
                <li>
                    <h4>Step 4: Configure Network</h4>
                    <p>On the mobile device, enable Personal Hotspot. Note the hotspot IP address (typically 192.168.43.1). Connect the Android TV to this hotspot via Wi-Fi.</p>
                </li>
